        "tags": [
          "dashboard"
        ],
        "summary": "Dashboard",
        "description": "Revenue by month, top products, and sales by employee and by country, for one date range.\n\nWithout `from`, the range starts on the first day of the month eleven months ago; without\n`to`, it ends today. Revenue is the order lines after discount, without freight. Orders\ncount to the start of the current minute.",
